      * BILLGEN - GENERATES A BILL FOR ONE MERIDIAN MUTUAL CUSTOMER.
      * CALLS PAYCALC FOR THE AMOUNT, THEN WRITES THE BILLS TABLE.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BILLGEN.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT BILL-FILE ASSIGN TO BILLFILE
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  BILL-FILE.
       01  BILL-FILE-REC        PIC X(80).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY CUSTREC.
       COPY BILLREC.
       01  WS-PAY-AMOUNT        PIC S9(7)V99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM CALC-AMOUNT
           PERFORM WRITE-BILL
           PERFORM CHECK-PAYMENTS
           STOP RUN.
       CALC-AMOUNT.
           CALL 'PAYCALC' USING BILL-RECORD WS-PAY-AMOUNT
           MOVE WS-PAY-AMOUNT TO BILL-AMOUNT.
       WRITE-BILL.
           EXEC SQL
               INSERT INTO BILLS
                   (BILL_ID, CUST_ID, AMOUNT)
               VALUES (:BILL-ID, :BILL-CUST-ID, :BILL-AMOUNT)
           END-EXEC
           EXEC SQL
               UPDATE BILLS
                  SET BILL_STATUS = 'OPEN'
                WHERE BILL_ID = :BILL-ID
           END-EXEC.
       CHECK-PAYMENTS.
           EXEC SQL
               SELECT PAY_AMOUNT
                 INTO :WS-PAY-AMOUNT
                 FROM PAYMENTS
                WHERE CUST_ID = :BILL-CUST-ID
           END-EXEC.
       HANDLE-ERROR.
           DISPLAY 'ERROR WRITING BILL'
           STOP RUN.
